/* The anesthetic choices behind each Mock OR Day model care plan.

   One entry per patient: the technique and why, the drugs by phase, the
   airway plan, extra monitors, and the surgical steps that matter to
   anesthesia. carePlanSheet.buildModelPlan turns these into a complete care
   plan (doses per kg become totals for this patient's weight) and fills the
   rest from the chart and the answer key. Draft content for faculty review.

   Drug rows: [drug, mg per kg, options] computes the total; options.unit
   'mcg' for mcg/kg, options.basis 'IBW' or 'LBW' for obese dosing,
   options.max caps the total, options.note is added. A row of three strings
   is used as written: [drug or agent, dose or setting, total or target]. */

